{"id": "geoq/concept/overview-geometric-quantization", "type": "concept", "title": "几何量子化总览：从相空间到量子希尔伯特空间", "track": "O", "track_name": "总览", "summary": "第 5 章主线：辛几何搭相空间，半经典给出 (L,Ω)，海森堡群给出表示模型，再由预量子化、极化与半形式三步组装成几何量子化。", "question": "拿到一个辛流形，几何量子化要怎么一步步造出量子希尔伯特空间？每一步各自解决了什么、又留下了什么缺口？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "geoq/concept/dirac-quantization", "geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "geoq/example/oscillator-half-form-spectrum"], "pages": [250, 296], "path": "cards/concepts/overview-geometric-quantization.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure", "type": "concept", "title": "相容复结构与可缩性", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "与辛形式相容的复结构使辛空间同时具备凯勒结构：二者合成对称正定内积；而全体相容复结构构成可缩空间。", "question": "为什么「保持 $\\omega$」还不足以挑出一个复结构，必须再加正性条件 $\\omega(u,Ju)>0$？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/symplectic-group", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "geoq/example/standard-compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/example/unitary-symplectic-intersection", "geoq/example/compatible-complex-structures-on-r2", "geoq/concept/polarization"], "pages": [251, 254], "path": "cards/concepts/compatible-complex-structure.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "type": "concept", "title": "余切丛的典范辛结构与刘维尔形式", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "对任意 $X$，$T^*X$ 上由 $\\lambda_\\xi=\\xi\\circ d\\pi$ 定义的整体 $1$-形式使 $d\\lambda$ 非退化；截面恒等式 $S_\\alpha^*\\lambda=\\alpha$ 把拉格朗日条件化为 $d\\alpha=0$。", "question": "为什么余切丛总带着一个不依赖任何选择的辛结构，而一般辛流形未必是某个余切丛？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/example/cotangent-bundle-symplectic", "geoq/example/exact-lagrangian-phase-function"], "pages": [261, 261], "path": "cards/concepts/cotangent-bundle.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "type": "concept", "title": "哈密顿向量场与泊松括号", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "由 $\\iota_{V_f}\\omega=df$ 定义的向量场 $V_f$ 与 $\\{f,g\\}=V_f(g)$ 构成李代数同态；$V_f$ 保辛形式与体积，且 $V_{\\{f,g\\}}=[V_f,V_g]$。", "question": "$\\{f,g\\}=V_f(g)$ 为什么自动满足雅可比恒等式，而 $f\\mapsto V_f$ 的核又是什么？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/example/hamiltonian-flow-symplectomorphism"], "pages": [259, 261], "path": "cards/concepts/hamiltonian-vector-field.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "type": "concept", "title": "拉格朗日子空间与格拉斯曼流形", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "辛形式在子空间上消失、且维数恰为全空间一半者称拉格朗日；全体这样的子空间构成紧齐性流形，酉群在其上可迁。", "question": "为什么迷向子空间的维数最多是一半，而达到一半的那些子空间恰好满足 $L=L^\\perp$？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/concept/maslov-index", "geoq/example/standard-lagrangian-subspaces", "geoq/example/maslov-index-rp1", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/polarization"], "pages": [254, 256], "path": "cards/concepts/lagrangian-grassmannian.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "type": "concept", "title": "拉格朗日子流形、可投影与相函数", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "半维且 $\\omega|_L=0$ 的子流形；在 $T^*X$ 上等价于 $\\lambda|_L$ 闭。闭 $1$-形式给出可投影者，恰当时相函数只定到常数，而圆例说明闭未必恰当。", "question": "为什么 $T^*X$ 里「拉格朗日」可以只用一个 $1$-形式是否闭来判断，而这个闭性又为何不等于恰当？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "geoq/example/exact-lagrangian-phase-function", "geoq/example/circle-lagrangian-in-r2"], "pages": [261, 262], "path": "cards/concepts/lagrangian-submanifold.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/maslov-index", "type": "concept", "title": "马斯洛夫指标与 $\\mathcal L(V)$ 的基本群", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "拉格朗日格拉斯曼流形的基本群是整数，生成元由行列式平方给出；环路对应的整数叫马斯洛夫指标，等于该复合映射的绕数。", "question": "为什么 $\\mathcal L(V)$ 的基本群恰是 $\\mathbb Z$，而它的生成元必须用 $\\det^2$ 而不是 $\\det$ 来写？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/concept/symplectic-group", "geoq/example/maslov-index-rp1", "geoq/example/sp2-equals-sl2", "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/concept/half-density"], "pages": [257, 258], "path": "cards/concepts/maslov-index.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/symplectic-group", "type": "concept", "title": "辛群 $\\operatorname{Sp}(V)$", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "保持辛配对的可逆线性变换组成辛群；在标准基下即满足分块矩阵方程的矩阵，维数 $n(2n+1)$，并与正交群、复线性群两两相交于酉群。", "question": "辛群、正交群与「与 $J$ 交换的线性群」三者之间为什么只两两交出酉群？辛群又为什么比正交群大？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "geoq/example/sp2-equals-sl2", "geoq/example/unitary-symplectic-intersection", "geoq/concept/polarization"], "pages": [251, 253], "path": "cards/concepts/symplectic-group.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "type": "concept", "title": "辛流形（symplectic manifold）", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "光滑流形配上闭的、逐点非退化的 $2$-形式；非退化把切空间与余切空间等同，闭性让哈密顿流保辛，$\\omega^n/n!$ 给出刘维尔体积。", "question": "为什么辛形式要同时要求「闭」与「非退化」，只留一条会丢掉什么？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "geoq/example/cotangent-bundle-symplectic"], "pages": [259, 260], "path": "cards/concepts/symplectic-manifold.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "type": "concept", "title": "辛向量空间与辛基", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "实向量空间配一个非退化斜对称双线性形式；非退化即零空间平凡，此时维数必为偶数，且总能取到把形式化为标准矩阵的辛基。", "question": "为什么辛向量空间的维数必然是偶数，而辛基又为什么能把 $\\omega$ 化成常值矩阵？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-group", "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "geoq/example/sp2-equals-sl2", "geoq/example/standard-compatible-complex-structure", "geoq/example/standard-lagrangian-subspaces"], "pages": [250, 251], "path": "cards/concepts/symplectic-vector-space.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "type": "concept", "title": "辛同胚与哈密顿流", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "满足 $\\varphi^*\\omega=\\omega$ 的微分同胚；哈密顿流是单参数辛同胚群，$f=f(q)$ 时它平移纤维，把 $L_\\alpha$ 送到 $L_{\\alpha+df}$。", "question": "为什么哈密顿方程的解一定保持辛形式，而保辛的变换又为什么不必是哈密顿流？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/example/hamiltonian-flow-symplectomorphism"], "pages": [263, 263], "path": "cards/concepts/symplectomorphism.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/circle-lagrangian-in-r2", "type": "example", "title": "$\\mathbb{R}^2=T^*\\mathbb{R}$ 中的圆是拉格朗日子流形", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "$L=\\{p^2+q^2=R^2\\}\\subset T^*\\mathbb{R}$ 是一维拉格朗日；算得 $\\lambda|_L=-R^2\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$、周期 $-\\pi R^2$，故闭而不恰当，且不可投影。", "question": "一维的圆为什么满足拉格朗日条件，而它的 $\\lambda|_L$ 又为什么没有整体原函数？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle"], "related": ["geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/example/exact-lagrangian-phase-function"], "pages": [262, 262], "path": "cards/examples/circle-lagrangian-in-r2.json"}
