{"id": "geoq/example/hamiltonian-flow-symplectomorphism", "type": "example", "title": "哈密顿流是辛同胚（$f=\\tfrac12q^2$ 与 $f=q^1q^2$）", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "对 $f=\\frac12q^2$ 解出 $V_f=q\\,\\partial_p$ 与 $\\varphi_t(q,p)=(q,p+tq)$，直接验证 $\\varphi_t^*\\omega=\\omega$；$f=q^1q^2$ 时交叉项同样相消。", "question": "解一次哈密顿方程，为什么流的拉回会让辛形式的修正项自动消失？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field"], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectomorphism", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/example/exact-lagrangian-phase-function"], "pages": [263, 263], "path": "cards/examples/hamiltonian-flow-symplectomorphism.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/maslov-index-rp1", "type": "example", "title": "$\\mathcal L(\\mathbb R^2)=\\mathbb{RP}^1$ 上的马斯洛夫指标", "track": "A", "track_name": "辛几何底座", "summary": "平面上的拉格朗日格拉斯曼流形是射影直线；绕单位圆一圈的环路经行列式平方后绕两圈，指标为 $2$。", "question": "在 $\\mathbb R^2$ 上「绕一圈」的马斯洛夫指标为什么是 $2$ 而不是 $1$？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/maslov-index", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian"], "related": ["geoq/concept/maslov-index", "geoq/example/standard-lagrangian-subspaces", "geoq/concept/compatible-complex-structure"], "pages": [258, 259], "path": "cards/examples/maslov-index-rp1.json"}
