{"id": "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "type": "concept", "title": "玻尔–索末菲量子化条件", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "拉格朗日子流形上刘维尔形式的限制自动闭，却未必恰当；要求相位因子沿每个闭链单值，就得到 ∮λ 落在 2πℏ 整数倍上的玻尔–索末菲条件。", "question": "为什么拉格朗日子流形上刘维尔形式的限制一定闭？玻尔–索末菲条件在什么情形下自动满足、什么情形下又必须打补丁？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/concept/maslov-index", "geoq/example/oscillator-ebk-spectrum"], "pages": [268, 269], "path": "cards/concepts/bohr-sommerfeld.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "type": "concept", "title": "几何半经典定态", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "定态的半经典信息浓缩为一对 (L,Ω)：拉格朗日子流形落在能量面上、半密度在哈密顿流下不变；这个定义不依赖投影坐标，因此能跨过焦散描述态。", "question": "几何半经典定态的两个部件各自承担什么信息，为什么这个定义在焦散处依然有意义？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "geoq/concept/half-density", "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/example/harmonic-oscillator-level-set"], "pages": [267, 269], "path": "cards/concepts/geometric-semiclassical-state.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/half-density", "type": "concept", "title": "密度、半密度与刘维尔测度", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "密度按雅可比行列式的绝对值变换，因此不依赖定向就能积分；把指数取成 1/2 得半密度，它的模方是测度，WKB 振幅与刘维尔型守恒律都写在它身上。", "question": "为什么 WKB 的振幅必须看成半密度而不是标量函数？半密度的哪条性质给出了沿哈密顿流的刘维尔型守恒律？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/example/harmonic-oscillator-level-set"], "pages": [266, 267], "path": "cards/concepts/half-density.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "type": "concept", "title": "马斯洛夫修正与 EBK 条件", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "半密度只能取到四分相位，沿闭链绕一圈多出 e^{−iπm/2}；把这份马斯洛夫相位并入玻尔–索末菲条件，得到 (1/2πℏ)∮λ−m/4∈ℤ 的凯勒–马斯洛夫（EBK）规则。", "question": "马斯洛夫修正为什么恰好是 m/4 而不是 m/2？它究竟从半密度的哪一个指数上冒出来？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/half-density", "geoq/concept/maslov-index", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-grassmannian", "geoq/example/oscillator-ebk-spectrum"], "pages": [270, 271], "path": "cards/concepts/maslov-correction.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "type": "concept", "title": "WKB 半经典解与哈密顿–雅可比方程", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "把定态波函数写成相位因子乘 ℏ 的幂级数，逐阶代入薛定谔方程：首阶给出哈密顿–雅可比方程，次阶给出输运方程，几何上等于在能量面上选定一张拉格朗日子流形。", "question": "WKB 拟设代入定态薛定谔方程后，ℏ 的零阶与一阶分别给出什么方程，它们各自的几何含义又是什么？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/half-density", "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/lagrangian-submanifold", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/example/harmonic-oscillator-level-set"], "pages": [263, 266], "path": "cards/concepts/wkb-approximation.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/harmonic-oscillator-level-set", "type": "example", "title": "一维谐振子的水平集与焦散", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "把一维谐振子的能量面解成相平面里的椭圆，验证它是拉格朗日子流形；再找出投影的临界点，得到左右两个焦散。", "question": "为什么谐振子的能量面是拉格朗日子流形，而它的焦散却不在子流形的奇点集里？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/wkb-approximation", "geoq/concept/half-density"], "related": ["geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state", "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/example/oscillator-ebk-spectrum"], "pages": [268, 268], "path": "cards/examples/harmonic-oscillator-level-set.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/oscillator-ebk-spectrum", "type": "example", "title": "谐振子的凯勒–马斯洛夫条件给出精确谱", "track": "B", "track_name": "半经典量子化", "summary": "沿椭圆的刘维尔积分是 2πE/ω，马斯洛夫指标为 2；代入 EBK 条件即得 E=ℏω(n+1/2)，与谐振子的精确谱逐项吻合。", "question": "为什么把刘维尔积分与马斯洛夫指标一起代入条件，就能得到谐振子的精确能谱？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/bohr-sommerfeld", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state"], "related": ["geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/example/harmonic-oscillator-level-set", "geoq/concept/geometric-semiclassical-state"], "pages": [271, 272], "path": "cards/examples/oscillator-ebk-spectrum.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "type": "concept", "title": "海森堡群 $H_V$ 与中心扩张", "track": "C", "track_name": "海森堡表示", "summary": "用指数映射把 $h_V$ 整体化为单连通幂零群 $H_V$；BCH 因二阶幂零而截断，群律只比向量加法多出 $\\frac12\\omega(u_1,u_2)$ 的中心项，这正是 $\\mathbb{R}$-中心扩张的非平凡 2-上闭链。", "question": "为什么海森堡群的乘法只需要一个 $\\frac12\\omega(u_1,u_2)$ 的中心修正，而这一项又为什么不能通过重新定义坐标消掉？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra", "geoq/concept/schrodinger-representation", "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann", "geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/symplectic-group"], "pages": [273, 273], "path": "cards/concepts/heisenberg-group.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra", "type": "concept", "title": "海森堡李代数 $h_V$", "track": "C", "track_name": "海森堡表示", "summary": "在 $2n$ 维辛空间 $V$ 上添一维中心 $K$，用辛配对定义括号 $[u,v]=\\omega(u,v)K$，得 $2n+1$ 维二阶幂零李代数；辛基下它化为 $n$ 组正则对易关系，辛群自动作用为自同构。", "question": "为什么海森堡李代数的括号只需由辛形式给出，而新增的基元 $K$ 必须落在中心？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-vector-space", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "geoq/concept/schrodinger-representation", "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann"], "pages": [272, 272], "path": "cards/concepts/heisenberg-lie-algebra.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/schrodinger-representation", "type": "concept", "title": "薛定谔表示 $T_\\hbar$", "track": "C", "track_name": "海森堡表示", "summary": "海森堡群在 $L^2(\\mathbb{R}^n)$ 上的酉表示：先平移 $\\mathbf x\\mapsto\\mathbf x-\\mathbf s$，再乘相位 $e^{\\frac{i}{\\hbar}(\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf x-\\frac12\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf s+\\lambda)}$；$\\hbar$ 只在相位里出现，标记中心作用 $K\\mapsto\\frac{i}{\\hbar}$。", "question": "$T_\\hbar$ 的相位里为什么必须有 $-\\frac12\\mathbf r\\cdot\\mathbf s$ 这一项，$\\hbar$ 又为什么只能待在分母上？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra", "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann", "geoq/concept/segal-bargmann-space"], "pages": [273, 275], "path": "cards/concepts/schrodinger-representation.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/segal-bargmann-space", "type": "concept", "title": "Segal–Bargmann 空间", "track": "C", "track_name": "海森堡表示", "summary": "$\\mathbb{C}^n$ 上以 $e^{-|z|^2/\\hbar}$ 为权的全纯 $L^2$ 空间；$a_i^\\dagger=z^i$ 与 $a_i=\\hbar\\partial_{z^i}$ 互为伴随，单项式基 $\\lambda_I$ 使它同构于福克空间，海森堡群在其上作用为巴格曼–福克表示。", "question": "为什么把权 $e^{-|z|^2/\\hbar}$ 放进内积之后，乘法算子 $z^i$ 的伴随就恰好是 $\\hbar\\partial_{z^i}$？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/schrodinger-representation", "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra"], "pages": [275, 280], "path": "cards/concepts/segal-bargmann-space.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann", "type": "concept", "title": "斯通–冯·诺依曼定理", "track": "C", "track_name": "海森堡表示", "summary": "固定中心特征 $\\rho(e^{\\lambda K})=e^{\\frac{i\\lambda}{\\hbar}}$ 后，海森堡群的不可约酉表示在酉等价意义下唯一，就是 $T_\\hbar$；等价算子只在差一个模 $1$ 相位时唯一。", "question": "为什么「不可约」加上「固定 $\\hbar$」这两条，就能把海森堡群的酉表示钉死成一个模型？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/schrodinger-representation", "geoq/concept/segal-bargmann-space", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-group", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra"], "pages": [275, 275], "path": "cards/concepts/stone-von-neumann.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/dirac-quantization", "type": "concept", "title": "狄拉克量子化原理 Q1–Q5", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "狄拉克把量子化定义为从经典可观测量到自伴算子的对应，并列出五条要求：实数线性、保单位、实函数自伴、括号关系、完全集保持。四条约束算子代数，第五条约束希尔伯特空间的大小。", "question": "狄拉克原理的五条要求各是什么？为什么 Q4 是核心，而 Q1–Q3 与 Q5 与它彼此独立？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/groenewold-van-hove", "geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/heisenberg-lie-algebra", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator"], "pages": [280, 281], "path": "cards/concepts/dirac-quantization.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/groenewold-van-hove", "type": "concept", "title": "格罗嫩沃尔德–范霍夫定理（Groenewold–Van Hove）", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "不存在把四次以下多项式都变成自伴算子、保单位、在低次上与标准实现一致、又满足括号关系的映射。证明把 $x^2p^2$ 写成两种泊松括号，两条路给出的算子相差 $\\hbar^2/3$。", "question": "为什么「满足 Q2 与 Q4、且在低次多项式上取标准值」这两件事在四次多项式上就打架？矛盾具体出在哪个恒等式？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/dirac-quantization", "geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/stone-von-neumann", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator"], "pages": [282, 284], "path": "cards/concepts/groenewold-van-hove.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/polarization", "type": "concept", "title": "极化：实极化与凯勒极化", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "极化是切丛复化里一族拉格朗日子空间：要求对李括号封闭、与共轭部分相交维数恒定。它把预量子化态砍掉一半变量，实极化给位置波函数，凯勒极化给全纯函数。", "question": "极化的三个条件各自排除什么？为什么沿 P 方向的方程 \\nabla_Xs=0 不会互相矛盾？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/example/real-polarization-r2n", "geoq/example/kahler-polarization-cn"], "pages": [287, 289], "path": "cards/concepts/polarization.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/prequantization", "type": "concept", "title": "预量子化线丛", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "用带相容联络的厄米线丛把经典可观测量提升为截面算子 Q(f)=iℏ∇_{V_f}+f；曲率锁定为 −(i/ℏ)ω 保证括号关系，但希尔伯特空间仍太大。", "question": "预量子化的曲率为什么必须等于 −(i/ℏ)ω？它满足狄拉克原理的哪几条，又为什么还不是真正的量子化？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/symplectic-manifold", "geoq/concept/quantization-condition", "geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "geoq/example/cotangent-bundle-quantizable", "geoq/example/s2-quantization-condition"], "pages": [284, 286], "path": "cards/concepts/prequantization.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/quantization-condition", "type": "concept", "title": "可量子化条件（陈类整性）", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "预量子化线丛存在当且仅当 $\\frac{1}{2\\pi\\hbar}[\\omega]$ 是整上同调类，即 $\\omega$ 在每个闭曲面上的积分除以 $2\\pi\\hbar$ 为整数。条件只依赖 $[\\omega]$，却随 $\\hbar$ 的标定而变。", "question": "为什么辛流形能否预量子化是一个拓扑问题？条件里的 $2\\pi\\hbar$ 从哪来，为什么不能换成 $2\\pi$？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/dirac-quantization", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle", "geoq/example/cotangent-bundle-quantizable", "geoq/example/s2-quantization-condition"], "pages": [286, 287], "path": "cards/concepts/quantization-condition.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "type": "concept", "title": "量子希尔伯特空间与半形式修正", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "在预量子化截面上再要求沿极化方向平行，得到只依赖一半变量的量子希尔伯特空间；紧流形的凯勒情形下它有限维，再把线丛换成张上半形式丛，谐振子谱就从 nℏ 抬成 (n+½)ℏ。", "question": "预量子化的截面空间为什么太大，加了极化条件之后为什么还要用 √K_M 再修一次？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "geoq/concept/maslov-correction", "geoq/concept/segal-bargmann-space", "geoq/example/oscillator-half-form-spectrum", "geoq/example/tensor-power-line-bundle"], "pages": [288, 296], "path": "cards/concepts/quantum-hilbert-space.json"}
{"id": "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "type": "concept", "title": "量子算子与 P-保持条件", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "只有当哈密顿向量场把极化映回自身时，预量子化算子 Q(f)=iℏ∇_{V_f}+f 才把 P-极化截面送到 P-极化截面。实极化下这类函数是 a(x)+Σb_i(x)p_i，凯勒极化下是二次多项式。", "question": "为什么 Q(f) 不能对任意光滑函数都定义在量子希尔伯特空间上？P-保持条件在 R^{2n} 与 C^n 里各筛出哪些函数？", "concept_refs": [], "related": ["geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/concept/hamiltonian-vector-field", "geoq/example/quantum-operators-real-polarization", "geoq/example/oscillator-half-form-spectrum"], "pages": [292, 296], "path": "cards/concepts/quantum-operator.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/cotangent-bundle-quantizable", "type": "example", "title": "余切丛总可量子化", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "余切丛上的刘维尔形式给出恰当的辛形式，陈类自动为零，因此任意余切丛都可预量子化，线丛取平凡丛即可。", "question": "为什么余切丛上的标准辛形式总满足预量子化条件，而球面上的面积形式却不行？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/quantization-condition"], "related": ["geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/concept/quantization-condition", "geoq/example/real-polarization-r2n", "geoq/concept/cotangent-bundle"], "pages": [287, 287], "path": "cards/examples/cotangent-bundle-quantizable.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/holomorphic-line-bundle-polarization", "type": "example", "title": "全纯线丛上的凯勒极化", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "对全纯线丛取相容联络，其反全纯分量就是 Dolbeault 算子；令辛形式为曲率的 $i\\hbar$ 倍，预量子化自动成立，极化截面即全纯截面。", "question": "当预量子化线丛本身就是全纯线丛时，凯勒极化会给出什么样的量子希尔伯特空间？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/quantization-condition"], "related": ["geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/quantization-condition", "geoq/example/kahler-polarization-cn", "geoq/example/tensor-power-line-bundle", "geoq/example/s2-quantization-condition"], "pages": [290, 291], "path": "cards/examples/holomorphic-line-bundle-polarization.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/kahler-polarization-cn", "type": "example", "title": "$\\mathbb{C}^n$ 的凯勒极化与全纯截面", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "用凯勒势定义辛形式与联络，取反全纯方向的极化后极化截面恰为全纯函数，内积带权 $e^{-K/\\hbar}$。", "question": "为什么凯勒流形上的极化自动选出全纯截面，而不必额外指定复结构的用法？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/prequantization"], "related": ["geoq/concept/polarization", "geoq/concept/prequantization", "geoq/example/real-polarization-r2n", "geoq/example/holomorphic-line-bundle-polarization", "geoq/concept/segal-bargmann-space"], "pages": [289, 290], "path": "cards/examples/kahler-polarization-cn.json"}
{"id": "geoq/example/oscillator-half-form-spectrum", "type": "example", "title": "凯勒极化、半形式与 $(n+\\frac12)\\hbar$ 谱", "track": "D", "track_name": "量子化机器", "summary": "在 C 上取 K=|z|² 与凯勒极化，全纯截面上的 Q(H)=ℏz∂_z 只有 nℏ 谱；把态换成 L⊗√K_M 的截面 z^n√dz 后，半形式的 ½ 权重把谱修正为 (n+½)ℏ。", "question": "半形式 √K_M 为什么恰好补上 ½ℏ，而不是别的数？", "concept_refs": ["geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/concept/quantum-operator", "geoq/concept/polarization"], "related": ["geoq/concept/quantum-hilbert-space", "geoq/example/tensor-power-line-bundle", "geoq/example/oscillator-ebk-spectrum"], "pages": [294, 296], "path": "cards/examples/oscillator-half-form-spectrum.json"}
